# CHANGE: 2026-10-31 — the module brochures are real PDFs in public/brochures/.
# Without this, git rendered the 7.7 MB CFA PDF as ~34k text lines in every diff
# (it has no early NUL byte) and a checkout on a machine with core.autocrlf=true
# could have rewritten its line endings and corrupted the file. Binaries are
# declared explicitly so they are never text-converted.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
